     5756   if available out-vatp_gds-dtl then do:
     5757     find first buf_out-vatp_gds-dtl where buf_out-vatp_gds-dtl.doc-code  =  t-doc.doc-code                and
     5758                                              buf_out-vatp_gds-dtl.artic     =  doc-line.artic                   and
