     5801     else do:
     5802       for each out-vatp_gds-dtl where out-vatp_gds-dtl.doc-code  = t-doc.doc-code  and
     5803                                          out-vatp_gds-dtl.artic     = doc-line.artic     and
     5804                                          out-vatp_gds-dtl.prod-type = doc-line.prod-type and
